   "summary": "In life, you must understand that although you don’t have everything, you definitely have something. In fact, there is something within you that the world cannot do without.",
   "key_scripture": "2 Co 10:12",
   "key_scripture_text": "¶ For we dare not make ourselves of the number, or compare ourselves with some that commend themselves: but they measuring themselves by themselves, and comparing themselves among themselves, are not wise",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "In life, you must understand that although you don’t have everything, you definitely have something. In fact, there is something within you that the world cannot do without. You are not like others and others are not like you; you are gloriously unique and hence there is no basis for comparison. There are many people who always want to compare their lives with those of others. This makes them to eventually lose grip of what they have and the resultant effect is inferiority complex."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "What makes you unique is inside you – dig it out. Your greatness will not come from outside but from within. The poor widow’s children nearly lost his two sons to the creditors because he underestimated the bottle of oil that was in her house (II Kings 4). It was the rod in the hands of Moses that God used to do wonders in the land of Egypt. THIS MEANS THAT WHAT IS IN YOUR HOUSE OR HANDS CAN CREATE THE WONDERS YOU DESIRE!"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Focus on what you have, build around it and make the most of it. In the process, you will suddenly discover that you have no basis for comparison with others. You may not have what others have but you possess within you what make you!"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "In 2023, look upward for divine help and look inward for what you can do! It is a sign of foolishness to be comparing your life with other unique destinies!"
    }
