   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "If there is a man to pray, then there is surely a God to answer! He is the prayer answering God and that’s why everyone must run to Him – Psalm 65:2."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Sanctification is the mother of manifestations. You can therefore only see the hand of God in your life if you are living holy. Hebrews 12:14 says, ‘Follow peace with all men and holiness without which no man can see God’"
    },
