     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Depression is the gateway to oppression. One of the most dangerous parties to attend is a ‘pity party’. Pity parties cause you to live in a realm of anxiety and worry. However, what you must know is that easiest route to worry, depression and apprehension is to attempt to care for yourself and to fight your own battles."
