     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "The Bible says that the glory of the latter house shall be greater than the former. God has so many wonderful plans for you but the question is, ‘Are you ready?’. Everything starts and ends with the heart. Therefore, what your heart cannot entertain, your hand can never obtain. God is a wise owner and an excellent manager. He will never commit into your hands, what your heart is not ready for."
    },
