    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "God gave Moses three million people to lead because he had a heart for them. Acts 7:23 says of Moses, “ And when he was full forty years old, it came into his heart to visit his brethren the children of Israel.” Jesus was given the whole world because He cares for it. When no one was unwilling to come and die for humanity to reconcile us back to God; Jesus was. He left the splendor and the grandeur of Heaven to die a painful and a shameful death on the Cross."
    },
