     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "If you are truly sanctified by God, the old sins that you once indulged in will no longer appeal to you. You will hate fornication, pornography, lies, masturbation, anger, theft, adultery, homosexuality or lesbianism, pride etc. all the days of your life. You will not tolerate for even a second any unforgiveness, bitterness and hatred. From today, allow “Jehovah M’kaddesh” to do a complete work in your life. May you truly know God as your sanctifier in Jesus Name."
