     "text": "If you don’t want God to stay off you, stay off sin. If you must keep God with you, then keep off sin. It is true that, in our modern world today, most people are living in sin and are living any how. However, if you don’t withdraw your hand from sin, God will withdraw His hand from your life. Don’t touch sin if you don’t want to be out of touch with God."
