     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Sanctification is the process of preparation for manifestation. The greater your desire for holiness, the higher you fly. You begin to see God’s hand launching you into higher realms of favour and glory, if you decide to live a holy life through the empowerment of the Spirit. ( Ezek. 36:27)"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "The Bible says in Rom. 6:14: “And sin shall have no dominion over you......”"
    },
