   "title": "Why Most People Are Not Happy",
   "summary": "Nobody can be truly happy when he is outside the will of God . One of the most horrible things that could happen to a person is when the person is outside where God wants him to be and he does not realize it until he gets to the grave.",
   "key_scripture": "2 Kings 5:12",
