  {
   "slug": "take-advantage-of-your-adversities",
   "order": 65,
   "title": "Take Advantage of Your Adversities",
   "summary": "There is one major truth you must embrace in the journey of life; you can put a good man down but you can never keep him down. That is why our Lord and Master Jesus Christ could not be detained by the powers of the grave.",
   "key_scripture": "Acts 2:24",
   "key_scripture_text": "Whom God hath raised up, having loosed the pains of death: because it was not possible that he should be holden of it.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "There is one major truth you must embrace in the journey of life; you can put a good man down but you can never keep him down. That is why our Lord and Master Jesus Christ could not be detained by the powers of the grave. After His crucifixion, He resurrected on the third day. Acts 2:24 says, ‘Whom God hath raised up, having loosed the pains of death: because it was not possible that he should be holden of it.’"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Never allow problems to remain with you. Through the empowerment of the Holy Spirit, quickly convert them into programmes that will result into progress. Challenges and problems are catalysts for progress; they are scaffolds you can step on to move to your next level."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Always learn to take advantage of adversities to make advancements. When the devil declares that it is the end for you; declare back to him that it can’t be the end; it is rather a bend. Look beyond your problems to go beyond. Think ahead of the challenges if you really want to emerge as the head in life."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "You must be like Isaac, don’t let strife and contentions hold you down - Gen. 26:1-14. In spite of the contentions, he persevered until he got to his Rehoboth, a place where God made room for him to be fruitful. Wherever there is a strife, you drive on to thrive forward."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "From today; nothing you face in the journey of your life will hold you down in Jesus Name!"
    }
   ],
   "prayer": "O Lord, empower me to persevere and win in spite of my challenges in Jesus Name!",
