   "title": "The Power to Start",
   "summary": "Most people think that their greatest challenge is the oppositions and confrontations they are facing in their destiny. Others also think it their background that is their impediment.",
   "key_scripture": "Job 8:7",
   "key_scripture_text": "Though thy beginning was small, yet thy latter end should greatly increase.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Most people think that their greatest challenge is the oppositions and confrontations they are facing in their destiny. Others also think it their background that is their impediment. There is also another group of people who think that they are not advancing in life because of their colour, race or ethnic group."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "However, what you must understand is that, none of the afore- mentioned factors is potent enough to stop your advancement. It is not oppositions or confrontation but the STRENGTH TO START that is the greatest challenge to the advancement of a person."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "There is no stopping to a starter. Once you can start you find yourself just going on into victory from victory. Anyone who can overcome starting will in all probability overcome oppositions on the way."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Whenever, you receive a vision or a dream from God, you must start running with it as soon as possible. Habakkuk 2:2 says, ‘And the LORD answered me, and said, Write the vision, and make it plain upon tables, that he may run that readeth it.’"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "An average plan that is acted upon is better than an excellent plan on which nothing is done. Always take steps no matter how small towards the realization of every vision that God has given you. Small steps is better than no steps. Start that business, start that building, start writing that book etc."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "If you can make the first move, your miracle will draw closer to you. Receive the power to start in Jesus Name!"
    }
   ],
