     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "II Kings 5: 16 But he said, “As the LORD lives, before whom I stand, I will receive nothing.” And he urged him to take it, but he refused. Prayerful men are faith-filled men. Whenever you read the Word of God and you receive a revelation, turn it into a prayer point. When you are sick, the Bible says that the PRAYER OF FAITH can bring you healing. Jas 5:15 And the prayer of faith shall save the sick, and the Lord shall raise him up; and if he have committed sins, they shall be forgiven him."
