     "text": "Beloved, the past has a great influence on the outcome of your future. Your past can affect your present destiny and imprison your future. YOUR PAST CAN BE LIKE GOALIATH AND STAND IN THE WAY OF YOUR FUTURE. If care is not taken the arrows received from the past can render your tomorrow impotent. That is why, you must seriously deal with your past if you want to move forward and succeed in life. Paul said in Philippians 3:13, ‘ Brethren, I do not count myself to have apprehended; but one thing I do, forgetting those things which are behind and reaching forward to those things which are ahead,’"
