   "summary": "You must develop an unquenchable love for the House of God if your desire is to grow in the spirit. In life, it is your company that determines your accomplishments and your companions direct your opinions.",
   "key_scripture": "Psalm 84:7",
   "key_scripture_text": "Vr.7 “They go from strength to strength ;everyone of them in zion appeareth before God",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "You must develop an unquenchable love for the House of God if your desire is to grow in the spirit. In life, it is your company that determines your accomplishments and your companions direct your opinions."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "It is therefore important to be in the right company in order to make the right progress in the area of spiritual growth. Therefore, going to church always is vital for your spiritual survival and growth."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "The Church is a community of fellow sinners saved by the Grace of God and called to walk alongside and help each other. Just as a student has no hope of getting to the university, If he or she doesn’t join a school, so does a baby Christian has no hope of growing in the Lord and getting to Heaven if he or she doesn’t go to church (Heb. 10:25)"
