    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Beloved, there is joy in the House of the Lord (Psalm 122:1). In the right church; You will have fellowship with God (1 Cor 1:9) and you will have fellowship with other believers and grow together with them (Acts 2:42)."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Again, it is in the church that God’s leaders, prepare you for the work of service until we grow into the full stature of God (Eph. 4:12). The worship, the encouragement, the prayer and other ministration all help you to move from one level of spiritual strength to another (Psalm 84:7)."
