    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Psalm 92:13 says, “Those that be planted in the house of the Lord shall flourish in the courts of God.” You must never be forced to go to Church. You must gladly find a Bible-believing church and attend regularly. As you get planted in such a church, you will surely begin to grow in the spirit on a consistent basis."
