     "text": "Acombination of Holy Spirit and human Spirit is what makes an excellent destiny. What man can do for himself; God will never do for him. Planning is as potent as prayer. This is because God does not only act according to your prayers but He equally acts according to your thinking. Ephesians 3:20 says “Now unto him that is able to do exceeding abundantly above all that we ASK OR THINK, according to the power that worketh in us,” ‘Asking’ is praying but ‘thinking’ is planning and God answers them both."
