  {
   "slug": "the-best-helping-hand",
   "order": 91,
   "title": "The Best Helping Hand",
   "summary": "Winston Churchill said, “Responsibility is the price for greatness”. Therefore unless you begin to take responsibility for the affairs of your life, you will die as a liability.",
   "key_scripture": "2 Timothy 1:6",
   "key_scripture_text": "Wherefore I put thee in remembrance that thou stir up the gift of God, which is in thee by the putting on of my hands.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Winston Churchill said, “Responsibility is the price for greatness”. Therefore unless you begin to take responsibility for the affairs of your life, you will die as a liability."
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "text": "Don’t expect anybody to live your life for you; that is irresponsibility. Somebody may start you up but no one can keep you on. For instance; there are some children who always want to depend on their parents even during their adulthood."
    },
